        | Type              | Distributed in-memory data store                       | Distributed in-memory data grid                                     |
        | Architecture      | Primarily client-server                                | Distributed cluster / data grid                                     |
        | Data structures   | String, Hash, List, Set, Sorted Set, Streams, etc.     | Distributed maps, sets, queues, topics, etc.                        |
        | Persistence       | Supports persistence                                   | Primarily in-memory, with persistence options                       |
        | Java integration  | Very good                                              | Excellent, especially Java/Spring                                   |
        | Distributed cache | ✅                                                      | ✅                                                                |
        | Pub/Sub           | ✅                                                      | ✅                                                                |
        | Clustering        | Strong                                                 | Strong                                                              |
